# CatDex — Animations

## Tokens (`src/theme/motion.ts`)

| Token | ms |
|-------|-----|
| `fast` | ~140 |
| `normal` / `standard` | ~220 |
| `slow` | ~320 |
| `reveal` | ~520 |

Also: springs in `motion.easing`, `pressScale` `0.98`, `cardPressScale` `0.99`.

## Primitives

`src/components/motion/`: `PressableScale`, `Breathing`, `Float`, `CascadeIn`, `XpTicker`.

Reward: `RewardCardFlip`, `RewardConfetti`, `RewardHalo`, `RewardStagedBeats`.

## Rules

- Prefer theme durations over magic numbers
- Use Reanimated (`withSpring`, `withTiming`, entering `FadeIn*`) for UI motion
- Always branch on `useReducedMotion()` — show final state quickly
- Gate haptics/SFX via `gameFeedback` + settings prefs
- Motion supports hierarchy (reward, onboarding, FAB) — not decorative noise on every text label

## Do not

- Block capture completion on long animation queues; allow skip/final state
- Run infinite heavy animations on hidden screens
